{"content_hash": "99f1d104659cca9f", "version_id": 103, "article_id": 11, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Scientists Fix a Small Mistake in a Hydrogen Study", "title_zh": "科学家更正了一项氢能研究中的小错误", "topic": "science", "source": "nature", "source_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-11244-6", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51733627413_8ff72ca7da_b.jpg", "credit": "₡ґǘșϯγ Ɗᶏ Ⱪᶅṏⱳդ · cc0 1.0 · via flickr"}, "published_date": "2026-10-06", "word_count": 203, "reading_minutes": 1.0, "lead": "A team of scientists at MIT published a correction to their hydrogen research. Although the mistake was small, the journal Nature shared the fix so that other researchers can trust the results.", "lead_zh": "麻省理工学院的一个科学家团队发表了他们氢能研究的一处更正。虽然这个错误很小，但《自然》杂志还是公布了修改，好让其他研究者能信任这些结果。", "preview": "In September 2026, a research team at the Massachusetts Institute of Technology (MIT) published a study in the journal Nature. The study was", "preview_zh": "2026年9月，麻省理工学院（MIT）的一个研究团队在《自然》杂志上发表了一项研究。这项研究是关于用钯膜提取氢气的一种方法。然而，作者后来发现其中一个图里有个小的标注错误，于是决定更正它。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 93, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@e099b16/content/audio/11/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 88.6, "size_bytes": 535392, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 249, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@e099b16/content/data/versions/103.json", "paragraphs": ["In September 2026, a research team at the Massachusetts Institute of Technology (MIT) published a study in the journal Nature. The study was about a way to extract hydrogen using a palladium membrane. However, the authors later found a small labelling mistake in one of their figures, so they decided to correct it.", "The mistake was in Figure 3c, which is a chart in the paper. The far-left bar had been labelled \"Pd-Ag under OCP\", but it should have been labelled \"Pd under OCP\". Because this label was wrong, readers might have misunderstood that part of the experiment. The correction was published on 6 October 2026.", "The original article came out on 9 September 2026. The team included Rui Zeng, Julian Ufert, Bryan Y. Tang, Ryan P. Bisbey, and Yogesh Surendranath. Although corrections like this are common in science, they are important because they keep the record honest. The authors have now fixed both the HTML and PDF versions of the paper.", "If you want to read the full study, you can find it in Nature with the DOI 10.1038/s41586-026-11244-6. The correction does not change the main findings of the research. It simply makes sure that the figure is correct for future readers."], "paragraphs_zh": ["2026年9月，麻省理工学院（MIT）的一个研究团队在《自然》杂志上发表了一项研究。这项研究是关于用钯膜提取氢气的一种方法。然而，作者后来发现其中一个图里有个小的标注错误，于是决定更正它。", "错误出在论文中的图3c，那是一张图表。最左边的柱子原本标的是“Pd-Ag under OCP”，但应该标成“Pd under OCP”。因为这个标签错了，读者可能会误解实验的那部分。更正于2026年10月6日发布。", "原论文于2026年9月9日发表。团队包括曾瑞、Julian Ufert、Bryan Y. Tang、Ryan P. Bisbey 和 Yogesh Surendranath。虽然这类更正在科学界很常见，但它们很重要，因为能保持记录的诚实。作者现在已经修正了论文的HTML和PDF版本。", "如果你想读完整的研究，可以在《自然》杂志上找到它，DOI是10.1038/s41586-026-11244-6。这次更正并没有改变研究的主要发现。它只是确保图表对未来的读者来说是准确的。"], "body": "In September 2026, a research team at the Massachusetts Institute of Technology (MIT) published a study in the journal Nature. The study was about a way to extract hydrogen using a palladium membrane. However, the authors later found a small labelling mistake in one of their figures, so they decided to correct it.\n\nThe mistake was in Figure 3c, which is a chart in the paper. The far-left bar had been labelled \"Pd-Ag under OCP\", but it should have been labelled \"Pd under OCP\". Because this label was wrong, readers might have misunderstood that part of the experiment. The correction was published on 6 October 2026.\n\nThe original article came out on 9 September 2026. The team included Rui Zeng, Julian Ufert, Bryan Y. Tang, Ryan P. Bisbey, and Yogesh Surendranath. Although corrections like this are common in science, they are important because they keep the record honest. The authors have now fixed both the HTML and PDF versions of the paper.\n\nIf you want to read the full study, you can find it in Nature with the DOI 10.1038/s41586-026-11244-6. The correction does not change the main findings of the research. It simply makes sure that the figure is correct for future readers.", "body_zh": "2026年9月，麻省理工学院（MIT）的一个研究团队在《自然》杂志上发表了一项研究。这项研究是关于用钯膜提取氢气的一种方法。然而，作者后来发现其中一个图里有个小的标注错误，于是决定更正它。\n\n错误出在论文中的图3c，那是一张图表。最左边的柱子原本标的是“Pd-Ag under OCP”，但应该标成“Pd under OCP”。因为这个标签错了，读者可能会误解实验的那部分。更正于2026年10月6日发布。\n\n原论文于2026年9月9日发表。团队包括曾瑞、Julian Ufert、Bryan Y. Tang、Ryan P. Bisbey 和 Yogesh Surendranath。虽然这类更正在科学界很常见，但它们很重要，因为能保持记录的诚实。作者现在已经修正了论文的HTML和PDF版本。\n\n如果你想读完整的研究，可以在《自然》杂志上找到它，DOI是10.1038/s41586-026-11244-6。这次更正并没有改变研究的主要发现。它只是确保图表对未来的读者来说是准确的。", "text": "In September 2026, a research team at the Massachusetts Institute of Technology (MIT) published a study in the journal Nature. The study was about a way to extract hydrogen using a palladium membrane. However, the authors later found a small labelling mistake in one of their figures, so they decided to correct it. The mistake was in Figure 3c, which is a chart in the paper. The far-left bar had been labelled \"Pd-Ag under OCP\", but it should have been labelled \"Pd under OCP\". Because this label was wrong, readers might have misunderstood that part of the experiment. The correction was published on 6 October 2026. The original article came out on 9 September 2026. The team included Rui Zeng, Julian Ufert, Bryan Y. Tang, Ryan P. Bisbey, and Yogesh Surendranath. Although corrections like this are common in science, they are important because they keep the record honest. The authors have now fixed both the HTML and PDF versions of the paper. If you want to read the full study, you can find it in Nature with the DOI 10.1038/s41586-026-11244-6. The correction does not change the main findings of the research. It simply makes sure that the figure is correct for future readers.", "vocab": [{"word": "correction", "pos": "noun", "zh": "更正", "note": "常指对已发表内容的修正"}, {"word": "extract", "pos": "verb", "zh": "提取", "note": "科学语境中常指分离出某种物质"}, {"word": "membrane", "pos": "noun", "zh": "膜", "note": "如细胞膜、过滤膜"}, {"word": "label", "pos": "verb", "zh": "标注", "note": "给图表或物品加标签"}, {"word": "figure", "pos": "noun", "zh": "图，图表", "note": "论文中的插图"}, {"word": "chart", "pos": "noun", "zh": "图表", "note": "用图形展示数据"}, {"word": "misunderstand", "pos": "verb", "zh": "误解", "note": "理解错误"}, {"word": "original", "pos": "adj", "zh": "最初的，原来的", "note": "指最早发表的版本"}, {"word": "DOI", "pos": "noun", "zh": "数字对象标识符", "note": "论文的唯一编号"}, {"word": "finding", "pos": "noun", "zh": "发现，研究结果", "note": "常用复数 findings"}], "title_original": "Author Correction: Anodic Pd membrane H<sub>2</sub> extraction enhances thermochemical dehydrogenation", "summary_original": "Nature, Published online: 06 October 2026;\ndoi:10.1038/s41586-026-11244-6\nAuthor Correction: Anodic Pd membrane H\n2\nextraction enhances thermochemical dehydrogenation", "body_original": "Download PDF\nAuthor Correction\nPublished:\n06 October 2026\nAuthor Correction: Anodic Pd membrane H\n2\nextraction enhances thermochemical dehydrogenation\nRui Zeng\n(\n曾瑞\n)\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0002-7577-767X\n1\n,\nJulian Ufert\nORCID:\norcid.org/0009-0004-6031-5773\n2\n,\nBryan Y. Tang\n1\n,\nRyan P. Bisbey\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0001-8699-5077\n1\n&\n…\nYogesh Surendranath\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0003-1016-3420\n1\n,\n2\nShow authors\nNature\n(\n2026\n)\nCite this article\nSave article\nView saved research\nThe\nOriginal Article\nwas published on 09 September 2026\nExplore related subjects\nDiscover the latest articles and news in related subjects.\nChemical engineering\nElectrocatalysis\nHeterogeneous catalysis\nCorrection to:\nNature\nhttps://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-026-11008-2\nPublished online 9 September 2026\nIn the version of the article 